        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml Cas1_DeploiementAgent\nactor \&quot;Ingénieur Système\&quot; as Ing\nparticipant \&quot;DataCollectionRule\&quot; as DCR\nparticipant \&quot;VirtualMachine\&quot; as VM\nparticipant \&quot;AzureMonitorAgent\&quot; as Agent\nparticipant \&quot;LogTable\&quot; as Table\n\nIng -&gt; DCR : créer(collectedStreams)\nactivate DCR\nDCR -&gt; DCR : définir streams\\n(Microsoft-SecurityEvent, Microsoft-Syslog)\nDCR -&gt; Agent : deployToAgent()\ndeactivate DCR\n\nactivate Agent\nAgent -&gt; VM : checkConnectivity()\nactivate VM\nVM --&gt; Agent : retourne(nsgRulesStatus = \&quot;OK\&quot;)\ndeactivate VM\n\nloop toutes les X minutes\n    Agent -&gt; Agent : lire événements locaux\\nfiltrés selon DCR\n    Agent -&gt; Table : envoyer(événement)\n    activate Table\n    Table --&gt; Agent : ack ingestion\n    deactivate Table\nend\n\nAgent --&gt; Ing : getHealthStatus() = \&quot;running\&quot;\ndeactivate Agent\n\nnote right of Table\n  Ex: Event ID 4624 (connexion réussie)\n  visible dans SecurityEvent &lt; 15 min\nend note\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="n-3zl9U9-RyPRubDXuU0-1">
